<section class="intro wrap">
  <div class="intro-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">The developer diary <span>/</span> Since September 2026</p>
    <h1>One system.<br>Many rooms.<br><span>A build in public.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">Building MultiroomKit: Swift tools for controlling Sonos, across Apple platforms and from AI agents.</p>
    <p class="intro-detail">A record of the choices, experiments, and course corrections along the way. Written by Nick Beadman, with Codex in the development process.</p>
  </div>
  <aside class="project-note" aria-label="Project status">
    <div class="note-top"><span>PROJECT / 001</span><span class="note-square" aria-hidden="true"></span></div>
    <p class="note-label">Currently</p>
    <h2>Laying the<br>groundwork.</h2>
    <p>The diary comes first. The library, command-line tool, and MCP server are the work ahead.</p>
    <dl><div><dt>Stage</dt><dd>Foundations</dd></div><div><dt>Focus</dt><dd>Scope & protocol research</dd></div></dl>
    <a href="{{ '/about/' | url }}">Read the project brief <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </aside>
</section>
<section class="journal wrap" aria-labelledby="journal-title">
  <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="journal-title">The journal</h2><span>{{ collections.entries | length }} {% if collections.entries.length == 1 %}entry{% else %}entries{% endif %}</span></div>
  {% for entry in collections.entries %}
  <article class="journal-entry">
    <div class="entry-meta"><span class="entry-number">{{ entry.data.entryNumber }}</span><time datetime="{{ entry.date | isoDate }}">{{ entry.date | displayDate }}</time><span>{{ entry.data.category }}</span></div>
    <div class="entry-content"><h3><a href="{{ entry.url | url }}">{{ entry.data.title }}</a></h3><p>{{ entry.data.description }}</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ entry.url | url }}">Read entry <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
<section class="principles wrap" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">What belongs here</p><h2 id="principles-title">The reasoning is<br>part of the project.</h2></div>
  <p>The useful story is how a decision held up: what I asked AI to help with, what needed changing, and how I checked the result. That's what this journal is for.</p>
</section>
